# apps/web

- next-intl, `fr` default; `lib/locales.ts` `ENABLED_LOCALES` controls what is shown (en/ar are plumbed, translations are a later add-on).
- Currency (TND/EUR) is a cookie, default TND. Show one currency at a time.
- Pages are server components; islands only for cart, gallery, forms. Data pages are dynamic (the api isn't needed at build).
- Only `/api/rpc/public/*` and `/api/files/*` are proxied (`WEB_ALLOWED`). Never call `admin` from here.
- Cart is a persisted zustand store; unique pieces cap at quantity 1; `quoteOnly` pieces link to `/custom?ref=`.
- noindex and a disallow-all robots unless `APP_ENV=production`.
